# 📌 Key Business Findings

## 💰 Overall Business Performance

- Generated a **total revenue of ₹3,520,984** from **1,000 customer orders**.
- Achieved an estimated **total profit of ₹1,056,295**, resulting in an overall **profit margin of approximately 30%**.
- Recorded an **average order value of ₹3,521**, indicating a healthy customer spending pattern.

---

## 🎉 Occasion-wise Sales Analysis

| Occasion | Revenue (₹) |
|----------|------------:|
| Anniversary | 674,634 |
| Raksha Bandhan | 631,585 |
| All Occasions | 586,176 |
| Holi | 574,682 |
| Diwali | 313,783 |

### Insights
- **Anniversary** generated the highest revenue among all occasions.
- **Raksha Bandhan** also contributed significantly to overall sales.
- **Diwali** recorded the lowest revenue, indicating comparatively lower customer demand.

