## 🚚 Delivery Performance

- **Average delivery time:** **5.53 days**
- **Longest average delivery time:** Holi (**5.78 days**)
- **Shortest average delivery time:** Diwali (**4.95 days**)
- **Cake** products required the longest delivery time (**6.02 days**).
- **Plants** recorded the fastest average delivery time (**5.11 days**).

